[2026-03-15T01:33:11.207Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TFxSVd6McTsweVnAZVNBBk","type":"tool_result","content":"  1260→### Component: RatingSliders\n  1261→\n  1262→#### Test: All six rating sliders display with default values\n  1263→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` for a completed booking.\n  1264→- **Expected:** Six rating sliders are visible with labels: \"Overall\", \"Cleanliness\", \"Accuracy\", \"Communication\", \"Location\", and \"Value\". Each slider defaults to a mid-range value (e.g., 3 out of 5) or is unset, and shows the current numeric value.\n  1265→\n  1266→#### Test: Adjust overall rating slider\n  1267→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1268→- **Action:** User drags the \"Overall\" slider to 5.\n  1269→- **Expected:** The \"Overall\" slider displays value 5. The numeric display next to the slider updates to \"5\". Other sliders remain at their previous values.\n  1270→\n  1271→#### Test: Adjust cleanliness rating slider\n  1272→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1273→- **Action:** User drags the \"Cleanliness\" slider to 4.\n  1274→- **Expected:** The \"Cleanliness\" slider displays value 4. The numeric display updates to \"4\".\n  1275→\n  1276→#### Test: Adjust accuracy rating slider\n  1277→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1278→- **Action:** User drags the \"Accuracy\" slider to 2.\n  1279→- **Expected:** The \"Accuracy\" slider displays value 2. The numeric display updates to \"2\".\n  1280→\n  1281→#### Test: Adjust communication rating slider\n  1282→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1283→- **Action:** User drags the \"Communication\" slider to 5.\n  1284→- **Expected:** The \"Communication\" slider displays value 5. The numeric display updates to \"5\".\n  1285→\n  1286→#### Test: Adjust location rating slider\n  1287→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1288→- **Action:** User drags the \"Location\" slider to 3.\n  1289→- **Expected:** The \"Location\" slider displays value 3. The numeric display updates to \"3\".\n  1290→\n  1291→#### Test: Adjust value rating slider\n  1292→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1293→- **Action:** User drags the \"Value\" slider to 1.\n  1294→- **Expected:** The \"Value\" slider displays value 1. The numeric display updates to \"1\".\n  1295→\n  1296→#### Test: Rating sliders enforce 1-5 range\n  1297→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n  1298→- **Action:** User interacts with any rating slider.\n  1299→- **Expected:** The slider only allows integer values from 1 to 5 inclusive. The slider cannot go below 1 or above 5.\n  1300→\n  1301→#### Test: Multiple sliders can be set independently\n  1302→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1303→- **Action:** User sets \"Overall\" to 5, \"Cleanliness\" to 4, \"Accuracy\" to 3, \"Communication\" to 5, \"Location\" to 4, \"Value\" to 2.\n  1304→- **Expected:** Each slider displays its independently set value. No slider affects another slider's value.\n  1305→\n  1306→#### Test: Rating slider visual feedback shows filled stars or highlighted segments\n  1307→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n  1308→- **Action:** User sets the \"Overall\" slider to 4.\n  1309→- **Expected:** The slider visually indicates the selected rating (e.g., filled stars up to 4 out of 5, or a highlighted slider track up to the 4 position). The visual feedback clearly distinguishes selected vs unselected portions.\n  1310→\n  1311→### Component: ReviewForm\n  1312→\n  1313→#### Test: Review form displays comment text area\n  1314→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` for a completed booking.\n  1315→- **Expected:** A text area is visible with a placeholder such as \"Write your review...\" or \"Tell others about your experience\" for entering the review comment.\n  1316→\n  1317→#### Test: Submit button is visible\n  1318→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n  1319→- **Expected:** A \"Submit Review\" button is visible at the bottom of the form.\n  1320→\n  1321→#### Test: Type a comment in the text area\n  1322→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with an empty comment text area.\n  1323→- **Action:** User types \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\" in the comment text area.\n  1324→- **Expected:** The text area displays the typed text \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\"\n  1325→\n  1326→#### Test: Submit review with all ratings and comment\n  1327→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page. User has set Overall to 5, Cleanliness to 5, Accuracy to 4, Communication to 5, Location to 4, Value to 4, and typed \"Wonderful experience, would definitely come back!\" in the comment area.\n  1328→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Submit Review\" button.\n  1329→- **Expected:** The review is submitted successfully via `POST /api/reviews`. The app navigates back to `/trips` (My Trips page). A success notification or message such as \"Review submitted successfully\" appears.\n  1330→\n  1331→#### Test: Submitted review appears on property detail page\n  1332→- **Initial state:** User just submitted a review for booking-789 (property \"Oceanfront Villa\") with Overall rating 5 and comment \"Wonderful experience, would definitely come back!\".\n  1333→- **Action:** User navigates to the property detail page for \"Oceanfront Villa\" (`/properties/:id`).\n  1334→- **Expected:** The reviews section shows the newly submitted review with the guest's name, the rating of 5, and the comment \"Wonderful experience, would definitely come back!\". The property's average rating and review count are updated.\n  1335→\n  1336→#### Test: Submitted review appears in user profile reviews list\n  1337→- **Initial state:** User just submitted a review for \"Oceanfront Villa\".\n  1338→- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n  1339→- **Expected:** The user's reviews list includes the newly submitted review for \"Oceanfront Villa\" with the correct rating and comment."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3ddd60a9-1f50-46d1-9553-9d4e1aeb2461","uuid":"539ab335-f0f2-4adf-bc44-05364b0aa86c","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md","content":"### Component: RatingSliders\n\n#### Test: All six rating sliders display with default values\n- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` for a completed booking.\n- **Expected:** Six rating sliders are visible with labels: \"Overall\", \"Cleanliness\", \"Accuracy\", \"Communication\", \"Location\", and \"Value\". Each slider defaults to a mid-range value (e.g., 3 out of 5) or is unset, and shows the current numeric value.\n\n#### Test: Adjust overall rating slider\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n- **Action:** User drags the \"Overall\" slider to 5.\n- **Expected:** The \"Overall\" slider displays value 5. The numeric display next to the slider updates to \"5\". Other sliders remain at their previous values.\n\n#### Test: Adjust cleanliness rating slider\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n- **Action:** User drags the \"Cleanliness\" slider to 4.\n- **Expected:** The \"Cleanliness\" slider displays value 4. The numeric display updates to \"4\".\n\n#### Test: Adjust accuracy rating slider\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n- **Action:** User drags the \"Accuracy\" slider to 2.\n- **Expected:** The \"Accuracy\" slider displays value 2. The numeric display updates to \"2\".\n\n#### Test: Adjust communication rating slider\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n- **Action:** User drags the \"Communication\" slider to 5.\n- **Expected:** The \"Communication\" slider displays value 5. The numeric display updates to \"5\".\n\n#### Test: Adjust location rating slider\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n- **Action:** User drags the \"Location\" slider to 3.\n- **Expected:** The \"Location\" slider displays value 3. The numeric display updates to \"3\".\n\n#### Test: Adjust value rating slider\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n- **Action:** User drags the \"Value\" slider to 1.\n- **Expected:** The \"Value\" slider displays value 1. The numeric display updates to \"1\".\n\n#### Test: Rating sliders enforce 1-5 range\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n- **Action:** User interacts with any rating slider.\n- **Expected:** The slider only allows integer values from 1 to 5 inclusive. The slider cannot go below 1 or above 5.\n\n#### Test: Multiple sliders can be set independently\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n- **Action:** User sets \"Overall\" to 5, \"Cleanliness\" to 4, \"Accuracy\" to 3, \"Communication\" to 5, \"Location\" to 4, \"Value\" to 2.\n- **Expected:** Each slider displays its independently set value. No slider affects another slider's value.\n\n#### Test: Rating slider visual feedback shows filled stars or highlighted segments\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n- **Action:** User sets the \"Overall\" slider to 4.\n- **Expected:** The slider visually indicates the selected rating (e.g., filled stars up to 4 out of 5, or a highlighted slider track up to the 4 position). The visual feedback clearly distinguishes selected vs unselected portions.\n\n### Component: ReviewForm\n\n#### Test: Review form displays comment text area\n- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` for a completed booking.\n- **Expected:** A text area is visible with a placeholder such as \"Write your review...\" or \"Tell others about your experience\" for entering the review comment.\n\n#### Test: Submit button is visible\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n- **Expected:** A \"Submit Review\" button is visible at the bottom of the form.\n\n#### Test: Type a comment in the text area\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with an empty comment text area.\n- **Action:** User types \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\" in the comment text area.\n- **Expected:** The text area displays the typed text \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\"\n\n#### Test: Submit review with all ratings and comment\n- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page. User has set Overall to 5, Cleanliness to 5, Accuracy to 4, Communication to 5, Location to 4, Value to 4, and typed \"Wonderful experience, would definitely come back!\" in the comment area.\n- **Action:** User clicks the \"Submit Review\" button.\n- **Expected:** The review is submitted successfully via `POST /api/reviews`. The app navigates back to `/trips` (My Trips page). A success notification or message such as \"Review submitted successfully\" appears.\n\n#### Test: Submitted review appears on property detail page\n- **Initial state:** User just submitted a review for booking-789 (property \"Oceanfront Villa\") with Overall rating 5 and comment \"Wonderful experience, would definitely come back!\".\n- **Action:** User navigates to the property detail page for \"Oceanfront Villa\" (`/properties/:id`).\n- **Expected:** The reviews section shows the newly submitted review with the guest's name, the rating of 5, and the comment \"Wonderful experience, would definitely come back!\". The property's average rating and review count are updated.\n\n#### Test: Submitted review appears in user profile reviews list\n- **Initial state:** User just submitted a review for \"Oceanfront Villa\".\n- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n- **Expected:** The user's reviews list includes the newly submitted review for \"Oceanfront Villa\" with the correct rating and comment.","numLines":80,"startLine":1260,"totalLines":1374}}}
